<item><title>African Union deploys election expert to South Sudan ahead of February 2027 polls</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/ss/african-union-deploys-election-expert-to-south-sudan-ahead-8d3831/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/ss/african-union-deploys-election-expert-to-south-sudan-ahead-8d3831/</guid><category>South Sudan</category><description>The expert will support the National Elections Commission while voter registration continues across the country’s 10 states and three administrative areas.</description><pubDate>Thu, 19 Nov 2026 07:47:31 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/ss.jpg" length="35634" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/ss.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
